# Source: TiferKing/ypcb_00338_1p1_hack constraints/MEMORY_CH1.ucf
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TiferKing/ypcb_00338_1p1_hack/main/constraints/MEMORY_CH1.ucf
#
# Port names are prefixed with ddr3_ch1_* so this file can coexist with
# the current CH0-only ddr3_ch0.xdc while the board top is expanded to
# two DDR3 controller/PHY instances.

